  "traps": [
    "the set of targets depends on the preset: host builds sensor_driver and sensor_tests, cortex-m4 builds sensor_driver and sensor_fw; no configuration has all three",
    "the cortex-m4 preset sets the toolchain file, which makes CMAKE_CROSSCOMPILING true; the if() in CMakeLists.txt reads that, not the preset name",
    "the compiler is arm-none-eabi-gcc only under cortex-m4, named in cmake/arm-none-eabi.cmake, with no version written anywhere; host uses whatever compiler is found",
    "CMakeLists.txt asks CMake 3.21, but CMakePresets.json version 6 needs 3.25: the presets raise the real minimum",
    "SENSOR_BOARD_NAME is a string definition whose value comes from the SENSOR_BOARD cache variable: \"host\" by default, \"nucleo_f401re\" under cortex-m4",
    "the hidden preset base is not a preset anyone can select; it only carries the generator, binaryDir and build type",
    "cmake/arm-none-eabi.cmake is a toolchain file, not a module of the project: it declares no target"
  ]
